            "detailed_description": "Frozen Synapse is the ultimate tactical game on PC and Mac.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\tIt brings the simultaneous turn-based strategy genre bang up-to-date and lets you give detailed, accurate orders to your squad: classic gameplay with a modern interface.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\tPlan your moves, test them out, then hit the &quot;Prime&quot; button: both you and your enemy's turns are executed simultaneously.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\tCompetitive-but-intuitive multiplayer and a huge single player campaign mean that Frozen Synapse will give you hours and hours of tactical delight.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Get a FREE full copy of the game for a friend with every purchase<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>5 challenging multiplayer modes, including the innovative bidding-based “Secure” and “Hostage Rescue”<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>55-mission single player campaign with dynamic dialogue and thrilling near-future narrative<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Powerful Skirmish Generator<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Facebook, Twitter and YouTube integration<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>15 Steam Achievements<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Integrated IRC chat as well as various community features<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Random generation combined with hand-crafted content means that levels and maps are different every time<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Critically-acclaimed electronica soundtrack by musician nervous_testpilot</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "Frozen Synapse is the ultimate tactical game on PC and Mac.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\tIt brings the simultaneous turn-based strategy genre bang up-to-date and lets you give detailed, accurate orders to your squad: classic gameplay with a modern interface.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\tPlan your moves, test them out, then hit the &quot;Prime&quot; button: both you and your enemy's turns are executed simultaneously.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\tCompetitive-but-intuitive multiplayer and a huge single player campaign mean that Frozen Synapse will give you hours and hours of tactical delight.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Get a FREE full copy of the game for a friend with every purchase<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>5 challenging multiplayer modes, including the innovative bidding-based “Secure” and “Hostage Rescue”<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>55-mission single player campaign with dynamic dialogue and thrilling near-future narrative<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Powerful Skirmish Generator<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Facebook, Twitter and YouTube integration<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>15 Steam Achievements<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Integrated IRC chat as well as various community features<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Random generation combined with hand-crafted content means that levels and maps are different every time<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Critically-acclaimed electronica soundtrack by musician nervous_testpilot</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Brings the simultaneous turn-based strategy genre up-to-date and lets you give detailed, accurate orders to your squad.",
